{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4659eeed9e2b9158ae352cf9e19dd47412f379f404c053c4ccad5ccf996d8d74", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の\nパジャマ特集の撮影だ。さて、静香の様子は……）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《アイグラ！！》睡衣特辑的日子。静香她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "f9f00e2ba537209bd85ebfbd458bce3eec03fbf04590d4e043bf83c72c045e60", "ja": "ふんふん……ふふふ～ん♪", "zh": "哼哼……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b8980da85b72786ba78c508d3990eb5c8ee06bdb2a9e7e06ac64caec205e1bc3", "ja": "お疲れ様、静香。\nずいぶん嬉しそうだけど、何かあったのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，静香。\n看起来特别开心，是遇到什么好事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "3e084848b35b25e628bee0f1d057f3ad79844dcc07f7c584cef471ca223cd2f5", "ja": "{$P$}！　\nこのパジャマ、とっても素敵ですよね♪", "zh": "{$P$}！　\n这套睡衣真的很棒对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "e6c1adb4ee9d8df7766fa06e6a86ddb668e7302b9725058348d377f76c604d2f", "ja": "オシャレでかわいくて……。撮影とはいえ、\n大人っぽいパジャマが着られるとは思いませんでした。", "zh": "时尚又可爱……没想到就算是拍摄，也能穿上这么成熟的睡衣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f3d2bf9d435ce390c0138789b014cbffecef5e228f15a8817ccd409cd13f99fe", "ja": "そうか！　ちょっと心配はあったけど……\n静香が気に入ってくれたみたいでよかった。", "zh": "这样啊！虽然之前确实有点担心……但静香好像很喜欢，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "35af2e3c543d60168e0a3f02ea6b0904b0e138a3cbc3a889c56b7f334291dc85", "ja": "心配……？　着る前にもチェックしましたけど、\n心配するようなことは何も……。", "zh": "担心……？穿上之前我也检查过了，没什么值得担心的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7688afb0fb8a88cbde12ebf7fee99e5628b035d967d385ed5e3d0ccf8e7b9ffb", "ja": "いや、その……デザインが大人すぎるから、\n静香は反対するんじゃないかって心配してたんだ。", "zh": "不是那个……我是担心静香会不会因为设计太成熟而反对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "99ff9b4faa5bd84c4379dcfbf83eb4cfdd8426d3ef139468ff062404248e1f61", "ja": "そんなことは……あれ？　でも言われてみれば……\n肩や背中が空いてて……裾も思ったより短い、かも？", "zh": "才不是那样……咦？不过你这么一说……\n\n肩膀和后背都露着……裙摆也比想象中短，可能确实是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1009_p", "source_sha256": "43e4738f9c20a066df0ac12a889ddce0830a0f49ffff84c7356189f3587476d8", "ja": "そうなんだ。結構大胆な衣装だから\n静香は、恥ずかしがるんじゃないかって……。", "zh": "是这样啊。毕竟是相当大胆的服装，我还想着静香会不会害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "088a4df9c0023bd65158202574a11d39d32019984584d14ba9b1e84d4374de45", "ja": "あ、当たり前じゃないですかっ！！", "zh": "啊，这不是理所当然的吗！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1011_p", "source_sha256": "432e353133e62c6d3c694c1227fe8fc3c4dd65df67702639127052f1da0e74ea", "ja": "うん、そうだよな。さっきは嬉しそうだったし、\nいけるかなと思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，说得也是啊。刚才看你挺开心的，\n我还以为能行呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "78833e16d5fce8e3eb55285f5016f6591ab862612787348c6be026a94aa3b997", "ja": "そんなわけないじゃないですか！　素敵な衣装だとは\n思いますけど……恥ずかしいものは恥ずかしいんです！", "zh": "怎么可能是那回事啊！虽然我觉得这套服装很漂亮……害羞就是害羞嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1013_p", "source_sha256": "41d5d90b135b1a3a335e89b9a0703833190cbbf18b6eb2d4e9a0f5767b4ac63a", "ja": "だよな……。静香の気持ちはわかった。\nそれじゃ、撮影は別のパジャマにしようか。", "zh": "就是嘛……我明白静香的心情了。\n那么，拍摄时换另一套睡衣吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c02bf452bff73b0e140b3dae0a7b83213c991bc5fa6bf40cc35f96005aa5743c", "ja": "気持ちよく撮影に挑める方が、いい写真になるだろう？\nだから別のに……。", "zh": "能舒舒服服地投入拍摄，才能拍出更好的照片吧？所以换一套别的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "b872399e7a338ea6b94239076d82a81f970a62bb8749f2b1f0a46afc61364820", "ja": "な、何言ってるんですか！　このままでも平気ですから\n……いつもより大人っぽい私を撮ってください！", "zh": "您、您在说什么啊！这样也没关系的……请拍下比平时更成熟的我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9e04b9b33976ac77e4963f92ee7044fd1e645d89a998f93b4bb89f7568a9550e", "ja": "えっ、いいのか？", "zh": "咦，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "4009f519941c32c51162e1bf348d876069c60692325629afda9eda2faf7ec6c1", "ja": "もちろんです！　折角の大人っぽい衣装……じゃなくて\nこれもお仕事ですからね。最後までやり切ります！", "zh": "当然了！难得穿上成熟风格的服装……不对，\n这也是工作嘛。我会坚持做到最后的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0323_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "47226f292fca990e7e773f7654dec81099047ff0e59cef83f06f41d8782085bb", "ja": "でも、あまりじっと見つめないでくださいね……。\n{$P$}に見られると恥ずかしいので。", "zh": "不过，请不要一直盯着我看……。\n因为被{$P$}先生看着，我会害羞的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
